# Optional Atlas coordinate-source assistance. Installed by the approved GitHub deployment.
# Reuses CoSpace's OIDC credentials for aud=atlas, scope=tool:atlas OBO exchange.
# Atlas must grant the chosen model route to product cospace; no vendor API key here.
# Confirmed worker02 Atlas address and CoSpace product grant, 2026-11-21.
# Production Environment variables choose these values; business code has no fallback route.
COSPACE_ATLAS_BASE_URL=http://100.76.219.48:3100
COSPACE_ATLAS_COORDINATE_ENDPOINT=chat/extract
# Allow HTTP only to a literal tailnet address (100.64.0.0/10); HTTPS preferred.
COSPACE_ATLAS_TAILNET_HTTP=1
